ummer fellowship from year-round scientific internships. Use an original research-fit worksheet and formal-approval timeline.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/day25/application-workspace-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-23\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-23\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/internships/ista-research-internships/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is there a central ISTernship 2027 summer deadline here?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The owner says that central programme is paused for 2026 and 2027.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does year-round mean any group must accept me?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Research fit, availability, funding and formal institutional approval remain necessary.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does an internship guarantee a later ISTA PhD place?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The owner describes PhD admission as a separate assessment without preferential treatment from this internship.\"}}]}"}}]],["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero inner-hero--compact inner-hero--guide inner-hero--visual","children":"$L1d"}],false,"$L1e","$L1f"]}]
