20:[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Original ISTA route choice","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Original ISTA route choice"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Route",{"scope":"col","children":"Route"}],["$","th","Current application approach",{"scope":"col","children":"Current application approach"}],["$","th","Decision boundary",{"scope":"col","children":"Decision boundary"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"ISTernship summer fellowship"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Central programme currently paused"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"No 2027 summer call inferred"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Year-round scientific internship"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Direct group or staff-scientist contact"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Case-specific availability and formal approval"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Other research visit"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Use the owner’s exact category"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Do not merge employment and external funding"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"]
21:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Check the year-round scope before writing to a group",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check the year-round scope before writing to a group"}],[["$","p","The scientific-internship page covers relevant bachelor’s/master’s students or recent graduates, with appointments of two to twelve months. Selection depends on group interest, salary funding and formal approval. Its instructions recommend early preparation; portal registration must be completed at least two months before the start, and applying at least four months ahead is recommended.",{"children":"The scientific-internship page covers relevant bachelor’s/master’s students or recent graduates, with appointments of two to twelve months. Selection depends on group interest, salary funding and formal approval. Its instructions recommend early preparation; portal registration must be completed at least two months before the start, and applying at least four months ahead is recommended."}],["$","p","Use your actual availability when judging feasibility. If a degree timetable leaves only a short break, compare it with the route’s minimum duration before asking a group to design a project. If an affiliation or project raises a research-security question, the institution must assess it; this guide cannot clear a case in advance.",{"children":"Use your actual availability when judging feasibility. If a degree timetable leaves only a short break, compare it with the route’s minimum duration before asking a group to design a project. If an affiliation or project raises a research-security question, the institution must assess it; this guide cannot clear a case in advance."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Build a research-fit worksheet from work you have read",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build a research-fit worksheet from work you have read"}],[["$","p","Select a group by its research question and methods, not only by institutional reputation. Read a recent paper or project description and write a brief explanation in your own words. Note what the work investigates, how evidence is collected or analysed and which part connects to something you have actually done.",{"children":"Select a group by its research question and methods, not only by institutional reputation. Read a recent paper or project description and write a brief explanation in your own words. Note what the work investigates, how evidence is collected or analysed and which part connects to something you have actually done."}],["$","p","In a fictional computing case, a student has implemented a simple classifier and evaluated errors on one dataset. The useful connection is a specific method or limitation in the group’s work, not a claim that they can lead an advanced project immediately. Distinguish existing skills from the training you hope to receive.",{"children":"In a fictional computing case, a student has implemented a simple classifier and evaluated errors on one dataset. The useful connection is a specific method or limitation in the group’s work, not a claim that they can lead an advanced project immediately. Distinguish existing skills from the training you hope to receive."}]],"$undefined","$L25","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L26","$L27","$L28"]}]
22:["$","section",null,{"className":"source-section","aria-labelledby":"official-sources","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"official-sources","children":"Official sources and verification"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Source records support the guide. Page update dates describe editorial changes; they do not mean every linked rule was checked again today. Reopen the current call for your programme and intake."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"source-grid","children":[["$","$L5","https://phd.pages.ista.ac.at/internships/",{"href":"https://phd.pages.ista.ac.at/internships/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"ISTA: internship route comparison"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Reviewed 23 November 2026. Central ISTernship paused 2026 and 2027; year-round scientific internships remain a distinct route."}]]}],["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M15 3h6v6","key":"1q9fwt"}],["path",{"d":"M10 14 21 3","key":"gplh6r"}],["path",{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6","key":"a6xqqp"}]],"className":"lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","https://phd.pages.ista.ac.at/scientific-internships/",{"href":"https://phd.pages.ista.ac.at/scientific-internships/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"ISTA: year-round scientific internship"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Reviewed 23 November 2026. Direct group contact and formal approval; funding/position availability assessed case by case."}]]}],["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$22:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
